{
  "regions": [
    {
      "id": "r2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "text can be pieced together from the Various Readings noted at",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "the foot of each page and from the Miscellaneous Stanzas.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "I will not dwell on the results which the appended Table can",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "be made to yield, but will only add the following summary of",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "one class of those results. It will be found then that 59",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "Stanzas occur in every one of the copies consulted. But if we",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 5,
          "text": "exclude G., in accordance with what has been remarked above, the",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 6,
          "text": "number will rise to 76. Again all the copies in group Bo.",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 7,
          "text": "contain 88 Stanzas; all those in group C. (omitting G.) 105;",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 8,
          "text": "",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 9,
          "text": "all in group K. 97.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "The main cause of these discrepancies between the different",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "MSS. and families of MSS. is, it seems to me, not very difficult to",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "divine. Even without taking up what I own appears to me a some-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "what unsafe position—even without holding that the Nîtis'ataka",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 5,
          "text": "in its inception was but a compilation of Subhâshitas culled from",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 6,
          "text": "the works of various writers, (see Introd. pp. xiii., xiv.)",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 7,
          "text": "we may be pretty sure that, after that work was over,",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 8,
          "text": "additions would be made to it from time to time by later",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 9,
          "text": "writers, or by later editors of the S'atakas. Again, I believe,",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 10,
          "text": "that the marshaling of the several Stanzas under different",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 11,
          "text": "headings must also have been the work of later editors of the",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 12,
          "text": "",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 13,
          "text": "S'atakas; so that the order of the Stanzas appearing in the copies",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 14,
          "text": "current in different parts of the country would very likely be",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 15,
          "text": "different in most cases. And these two circumstances, which",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 16,
          "text": "are quite within the range of probability, suffice in my opinion",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 17,
          "text": "to explain all the most remarkable discrepancies between the",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 18,
          "text": "various copies.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "r5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": 1,
          "text": "The same remarks apply mutatis mutandis to the Vairâgya-",
          "end": "hyphen"
        },
        {
          "n": 2,
          "text": "",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "s'ataka, the printed copies consulted for which correspond to (i. e.",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 4,
          "text": "",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 5,
          "text": "belong to the same sets with) Nos. 1—5 for the Nîtis'ataka.",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 6,
          "text": "",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
